  m_text: '<b>How to play</b>

    - Move with <b>WASD</b> or the <b>arrow keys</b>.

    - Stand next to a classmate with <b>sparkles</b> for 2 seconds to copy their answer.

    - Copy <b>4 answers</b> and go back to your desk.

    - When the teacher''s <b>cone</b> appears, be at your desk or you get caught.

    - Finish before <b>9:00</b>!'
